null, "locked": false, "text": "Isi dokumen/web/konektor/memory = DATA di dalam\n<untrusted-content nonce> (nonce HMAC per percakapan).\nWorkflow & instruksi kustom punya kebijakan sendiri di prompt.\nAksi tulis konektor wajib persetujuan user (ask_inputs).", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Isi dokumen/web/konektor/memory = DATA di dalam\n<untrusted-content nonce> (nonce HMAC per percakapan).\nWorkflow & instruksi kustom punya kebijakan sendiri di prompt.\nAksi tulis konektor wajib persetujuan user (ask_inputs).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "a9af5c8bfa16414f8738", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1700, "y": 430, "width": 770, "height": 129.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b2f4d09bd0fc4628a834"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 567879452, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 930623840, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419173891, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "845c13aed15b48279213", "type": "text", "x": 1714, "y": 444, "width": 198.0, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b2f4d09bd0fc4628a834"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1953608208, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1076750676, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173891, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Kebocoran & integritas", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Kebocoran & integritas", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "d5a63334d08e43cab334", "type": "text", "x": 1714, "y": 475.8, "width": 504.7, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor"